# Claude Code's per-directory settings. LOCAL by convention and by name: it
# holds whatever permission rules and modes ulu has granted on THIS machine,
# which is a property of the machine and the person, not of the installer.
#
# It was tracked until 2026-08-01, in a PUBLIC repo. Nothing secret was in it,
# but it is the wrong file to publish — and it is the file a permission mode
# lands in, so the next entry could have been an announcement that this
# checkout runs without permission prompts.
#
# `.claude/settings.json` (project-wide, team-shared) is deliberately NOT
# ignored: if this repo ever needs a checked-in Claude Code setting, that is
# where it belongs, in the open.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Written by stage 3 on every run, in the working copy itself.
stage3.log
